[I] Multiband crossover filter for JACK

[T] Zita-lrx is a command line JACK application providing 2, 3 or 4-band,
[T] 4th order crossover filters, continuously variable between Linkwitz-
[T] Riley and Butterworth types, with exactly phase matched outputs.

[U] https://kokkinizita.linuxaudio.org/linuxaudio/

[A] Kokkini Zita
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

